            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kennedy asked whether courts must treat as binding a legal proposition that they think is \u201cdead wrong.\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice SCALIA",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "c148bc7cb60f4a936abd0ea2f75c723ded54fb9be476b4cf6341319ffc55391d",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-c148bc7cb60f-0001-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 21,
              "start": 21
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Scalia asked what would happen if a new company, not existing when the regulation was issued, sought to challenge the regulation\u2019s conformity with the statute."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice GINSBURG",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "c148bc7cb60f4a936abd0ea2f75c723ded54fb9be476b4cf6341319ffc55391d",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-c148bc7cb60f-0001-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 22,
              "start": 22
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice GINSBURG, justice Ginsburg inquired whether a new company could raise a declaration of non\u2011applicability."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Stevens",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "c148bc7cb60f4a936abd0ea2f75c723ded54fb9be476b4cf6341319ffc55391d",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-c148bc7cb60f-0002-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 39,
              "start": 39
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Stevens, justice Stevens questioned whether the agency could adopt one definition of \u201cmodification\u201d for ten years and then change it for all programs."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Stevens",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "c148bc7cb60f4a936abd0ea2f75c723ded54fb9be476b4cf6341319ffc55391d",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-c148bc7cb60f-0002-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 44,
              "start": 44
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Stevens also asked whether the statutory text requires a uniform definition of \u201cmodification\u201d across all regulations."
      }
    ],
